"Trestly's pool is paused right now, so swaps are stopped for the moment." = "Trestly 的资金池目前已暂停，兑换暂时停止。";
"The pool's circuit breaker limits sells right now. Try a smaller amount, or again later." = "资金池的熔断机制目前限制卖出。请尝试更小的金额，或稍后再试。";
"Swap sent" = "兑换已发送";
"ChangeNOW swaps aren't available in this build." = "此版本不提供 ChangeNOW 兑换。";
"Built and checked by Trestly's own code inside K. If the pool moves first, it quotes again: it goes ahead only at this quote or better, asks you again for less, and never goes below your minimum, 1% under the quote." = "由 Trestly 自己的代码在 K 内构建和检查。如果资金池先变动，会重新报价：只按此报价或更优的价格进行，更少时会再次询问你，且绝不低于你的最低值，即比报价低 1%。";
