"Scan a KCC-3 address from KasSigner's address screen." = "从 KasSigner 的地址界面扫描一个 KCC-3 地址。";
"Stop Watching" = "停止监视";
"Removes this quantum address from the account. Scan it again to add it back." = "从账户中移除这个量子地址。再次扫描即可重新添加。";
"Quantum-Resistant Address" = "抗量子地址";
"On KasSigner, open the KCC-3 address you want and scan its QR code. Its key stays on the unit until the address spends." = "在 KasSigner 上打开你要的 KCC-3 地址并扫描其二维码。在该地址花费之前，其密钥一直留在设备上。";
"Address Number on KasSigner" = "KasSigner 上的地址编号";
"The number KasSigner shows for this address. With it the unit finds the key at once when signing; without it the unit searches for it." = "KasSigner 为此地址显示的编号。有了它，设备签名时能立即找到密钥；没有它，设备会搜索密钥。";
"Add Quantum Address" = "添加量子地址";
"The address number must be a whole number." = "地址编号必须是整数。";
"Needs KasSigner v1.1 or later, which signs quantum-resistant (KCC-3) addresses." = "需要 KasSigner v1.1 或更高版本，它可以签署抗量子（KCC-3）地址。";
"The change returns to this address, whose key this send puts on chain. Add another quantum address from KasSigner to keep change quantum-safe." = "找零会回到这个地址，而这次发送会把它的密钥公开到链上。从 KasSigner 再添加一个量子地址，可让找零保持抗量子。";
"The change goes to an unused quantum address of this account, since this send puts this address's key on chain." = "找零会转到此账户一个未使用的量子地址，因为这次发送会把这个地址的密钥公开到链上。";
"kaspa:pq..." = "kaspa:pq...";
"KasSigner didn't return the key script for this quantum-resistant address, so it won't be broadcast. Check the unit runs KasSigner v1.1 or later and holds this address." = "KasSigner 没有返回这个抗量子地址的密钥脚本，因此不会广播。请检查设备运行的是 KasSigner v1.1 或更高版本，并且持有这个地址。";
"The signed transaction adds covenant terms this send never asked for, so it won't be broadcast." = "签名后的交易添加了这次发送从未要求的契约条款，因此不会广播。";

/* Cold Storage quantum addresses, part 2 (2026-11-25) */
"Quantum Address" = "量子地址";
"Quantum Change Address" = "量子找零地址";
"Quantum Address #%lld" = "量子地址 #%lld";
"Quantum Change Address #%lld" = "量子找零地址 #%lld";
"That address is already in your Cold Storage account “%@”." = "该地址已在你的冷存储账户“%@”中。";
"This send puts this address's key on chain, so its change can't come back here. Add an unused quantum-resistant address from KasSigner first (a change address, #0 to #4, is best), or send the whole balance." = "这次发送会把这个地址的密钥公开到链上，所以找零不能回到这里。请先从 KasSigner 添加一个未使用的抗量子地址（最好是找零地址 #0 到 #4），或发送全部余额。";
"Compounding puts this address's key on chain, so its coins move to an unused quantum-resistant address of this account. Add one from KasSigner first (a change address, #0 to #4, is best)." = "合并会把这个地址的密钥公开到链上，所以它的币会转到此账户一个未使用的抗量子地址。请先从 KasSigner 添加一个（最好是找零地址 #0 到 #4）。";
"Stop Watching This Address?" = "停止监视这个地址？";
"Its %@ KAS stay on chain at this address, on your KasSigner; K only stops showing them. Scan the address again from KasSigner to watch it again." = "它的 %@ KAS 仍在链上的这个地址里，在你的 KasSigner 上；K 只是不再显示。从 KasSigner 再次扫描该地址即可重新监视。";
"Edit Address Number" = "编辑地址编号";
"The number and chain KasSigner shows for this address." = "KasSigner 为此地址显示的编号和链。";
"Chain" = "链";
"The number KasSigner shows for this address, and whether it is a receive or a change address. With it the unit finds the key at once when signing; without it the unit searches for it. KasSigner marks change sent to its change addresses #0 to #4 as change; any other address it shows as a payment." = "KasSigner 为此地址显示的编号，以及它是收款地址还是找零地址。有了它，设备签名时能立即找到密钥；没有它，设备会搜索密钥。KasSigner 把发往其找零地址 #0 到 #4 的找零标为找零；其他地址都显示为付款。";
"That number is too large: KasSigner's address numbers are below 2147483648." = "这个编号太大：KasSigner 的地址编号小于 2147483648。";
"Moves all of this address's coins into one, at an unused quantum-resistant address of this account: this transaction puts this address's key on chain." = "把这个地址的所有币合成一个，转到此账户一个未使用的抗量子地址：这笔交易会把这个地址的密钥公开到链上。";
"This address holds more coins than one transaction can spend: %lld stay behind the key this send puts on chain. Send them on in another transaction right after." = "这个地址的币超过一笔交易能花费的数量：%lld 个会留在这次发送公开到链上的密钥后面。请紧接着用另一笔交易把它们转走。";
"The coins move to your quantum address:" = "币会转到你的量子地址：";
"The change goes to your quantum address:" = "找零会转到你的量子地址：";
"KasSigner shows this output as change." = "KasSigner 将此输出显示为找零。";
"KasSigner will show this output as an ordinary payment, not as change: check it is this address before you sign." = "KasSigner 会把此输出显示为普通付款，而不是找零：签名前请确认是这个地址。";
"Sign Without the Address Number" = "不带地址编号签名";
"If KasSigner refuses this request, the address number may be wrong. Without it, the unit looks for the address itself. Edit Address Number puts it right for next time." = "如果 KasSigner 拒绝此请求，地址编号可能有误。没有编号时，设备会自行查找地址。“编辑地址编号”可为下次改正。";
"Combines all UTXOs at this address into one at an unused quantum-resistant address of this account, since this puts this address's key on chain." = "把此地址的所有 UTXO 合并为一个，放到此账户一个未使用的抗量子地址，因为这会把这个地址的密钥公开到链上。";
"Quantum-Resistant Addresses" = "抗量子地址";
